  {
    "user": "U08J6JR5SNQ",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1771737509.935099",
    "client_msg_id": "20fa9091-fd27-4609-87ff-3cc878e4904a",
    "text": "<https://github.com/digitaldemocracy2030/kouchou-ai/pull/804>\n動作確認が取れたので、WIPを外しました。\n現在は、mainで1MBを超えるCSVをアップロードしようとすると、投稿ボタンを押しても画面遷移が行われません（エラーになっているが、エラーを握りつぶしているので、何も起きなくなる）\nこのパッチを当てると、100MBのファイルまでアップロードできるようになります。",
    "team": "T08FL58DC9K",
    "attachments": [
      {
        "image_url": "https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/962298/553079715-c76a0937-a996-4957-b473-966fe0bdeac0.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzE3Mzc4MTEsIm5iZiI6MTc3MTczNzUxMSwicGF0aCI6Ii85NjIyOTgvNTUzMDc5NzE1LWM3NmEwOTM3LWE5OTYtNDk1Ny1iNDczLTk2NmZlMGJkZWFjMC5wbmc_.6hyLJ6-XVaEoA2hWuyvOiuJz2wQ-sjWCFvVYG_U7y8c",
        "image_width": 896,
        "image_height": 429,
        "image_bytes": 50330,
        "id": 1,
        "footer_icon": "https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png",
        "ts": 1771726900,
        "color": "36a64f",
        "bot_id": "B08HGALULNT",
        "bot_team_id": "T08FL58DC9K",
        "app_unfurl_url": "https://github.com/digitaldemocracy2030/kouchou-ai/pull/804",
        "is_app_unfurl": true,
        "app_id": "A01BP7R4KNY",
        "fallback": "896x429px image",
        "text": "Submitting a ~2MB CSV caused the submit button to spin indefinitely. The parsed CSV is serialized as JSON (with repeated field names per row) and passed through a Next.js Server Action — this payload routinely exceeds Next.js's default 1MB server action body limit. The framework rejects the request silently before the handler runs, the uncaught rejection skips `setLoading(false)`, and the button never recovers.\n\n## Changes\n\n• *`apps/admin/next.config.ts`*: Raise `serverActions.bodySizeLimit` to `100mb`  \nserverActions: {  \n  bodySizeLimit: \"100mb\",  \n},\n• *`apps/admin/app/create/page.tsx`*: Wrap the `createReport` call in `try/catch` so `setLoading(false)` is always reached on any error path; on success, `return` early before reaching it to avoid a state update on an unmounting component  \ntry {  \n  const result = await createReport({ ... });  \n  if (result.success) {  \n    router.replace(\"/\");  \n    return;  // skip setLoading — navigating away  \n  }  \n  toaster.create({ type: \"error\", ... });  \n} catch (e) {  \n  toaster.create({ type: \"error\", description: \"送信データが大きすぎるか、通信エラーが発生しました\" });  \n}  \nsetLoading(false);\nOriginal prompt \n\n> ---\n> \n> _This section details on the original issue you should resolve_\n> \n> <issue_title>[BUG] 巨大なCSVを分析にかけると、分析開始のボタンのアイコンがぐるぐる回ったまま帰ってこなくなる</issue_title>  \n> <issue_description>### 概要\n> \n> 2MB程度の巨大なCSVを分析にかけると、分析開始のボタンのアイコンがぐるぐる回ったまま帰ってこなくなる。\n> \n> ### 再現手順\n> \n> 1. このgistからサンプルデータをダウンロードして使う <https://gist.github.com/tokoroten/0115947bc25a53caa53d2f1e55a0b1df|https://gist.github.com/tokoroten/0115947bc25a53caa53d2f1e55a0b1df>\n> \n> ### 期待する動作\n> \n> すぐに画面遷移してレポート一覧画面に遷移する。\n> \n> ### スクリーンショット・ログ\n> \n> <https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/962298/553079715-c76a0937-a996-4957-b473-966fe0bdeac0.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzE3Mzc4MTEsIm5iZiI6MTc3MTczNzUxMSwicGF0aCI6Ii85NjIyOTgvNTUzMDc5NzE1LWM3NmEwOTM3LWE5OTYtNDk1Ny1iNDczLTk2NmZlMGJkZWFjMC5wbmc_.6hyLJ6-XVaEoA2hWuyvOiuJz2wQ-sjWCFvVYG_U7y8c|[Image](https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/962298/553079715-c76a0937-a996-4957-b473-966fe0bdeac0.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzE3Mzc4MTEsIm5iZiI6MTc3MTczNzUxMSwicGF0aCI6Ii85NjIyOTgvNTUzMDc5NzE1LWM3NmEwOTM3LWE5OTYtNDk1Ny1iNDczLTk2NmZlMGJkZWFjMC5wbmc_.6hyLJ6-XVaEoA2hWuyvOiuJz2wQ-sjWCFvVYG_U7y8c)> \n> \n> ### その他\n> \n> ## Comments on the Issue (you are @copilot in this section)\n\n• Fixes <https://github.com/digitaldemocracy2030/kouchou-ai/issues/803|#803>\n\n---\n\n:sparkles: Let Copilot coding agent <https://github.com/digitaldemocracy2030/kouchou-ai/issues/new?title=%E2%9C%A8+Set+up+Copilot+instructions&body=Configure%20instructions%20for%20this%20repository%20as%20documented%20in%20%5BBest%20practices%20for%20Copilot%20coding%20agent%20in%20your%20repository%5D%28https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-tips%29%2E%0A%0A%3COnboard%20this%20repo%3E&assignees=copilot|set things up for you> — coding agent works faster and does higher quality work when set up for your repo.",
